# ==============================================================================
# FILE HEADER: Git Exclusions — Antigravity Admin Policy Studio
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   Prevents accidental commits of environment files, secrets, certificates,
#   virtual environments, Python bytecode, and IDE/OS metadata.
#
# Architecture / Context:
#   Scoped to `agy-policy-studio/` for standalone Git, Docker, or Cloud
#   Build packaging.
#
# Dependencies / Side Effects:
#   Enforces the strict No-Hardcoding & Secrets Protection standard.
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Secrets, Environment Configs & Certificates
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
*.local.json

# 2. Python Virtual Environments, Bytecode & Test Caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
env/
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# 3. Exported Bundles & Temporary Scratch Outputs
*.zip
tmp/
temp/
*.log

# 4. OS & Editor Noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
